              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "CLAIMED: of 613319 crosses the corpus's own integers generate, 514160 are forced by an operator's algebra, 452 are stated, and 98707 remain — and the three account for the whole, 514160 + 452 + 98707 = 613319."
