              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "CLAIMED: of 98707 unstated crosses, 43799 join integers no single wing carries all three of — over two fifths and under a half, since 43799 × 5 > 98707 × 2 and 43799 × 2 < 98707."
